---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PostCard from '../components/PostCard.astro';
import archive from '../assets/images/archive-building.jpg';
import postOffice from '../assets/images/post-office.jpg';
import { APP_STORE_URL, TESTFLIGHT_URL, getPosts, url } from '../consts';

const posts = (await getPosts()).slice(0, 2);
---
<BaseLayout title="Casebook" stickyHeader>
  <section class="hero" aria-label="소개">
    <div class="wrap hero-inner">
      <p class="product">Casebook</p>
      <h1>숨겨진 사건의 진실.</h1>
      <p class="lede">사건 현장을 조사하고 누가 · 왜 · 어떻게를 추리하세요. 직접 만든 사건은 공공 사건기록보관소에서 다른 탐정과 나눠요.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        {APP_STORE_URL && <a class="pill store" href={APP_STORE_URL}>App Store에서 받기</a>}
        {TESTFLIGHT_URL && <a class="pill store" href={TESTFLIGHT_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">베타 체험하기 (TestFlight)</a>}
        <a class="more" href={url('blog/')}>개발 블로그 읽기 ›</a>
      </div>
      <p class="platforms">iPhone · iPad · Mac · Apple Vision Pro</p>
      <Image class="hero-image" src={archive} alt="빗속의 공공 사건기록보관소 건물" widths={[640, 980, 1960]} sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 980px" loading="eager" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="home">
    <div class="wrap sections">
      {posts.length > 0 && (
        <section aria-labelledby="blog-title">
          <div class="section-head">
            <h2 id="blog-title">개발 블로그.</h2>
            <a class="more" href={url('blog/')}>모든 글 보기 ›</a>
          </div>
          <div class="grid">
            {posts.map((post) => <PostCard post={post} />)}
          </div>
        </section>
      )}

      <section aria-labelledby="docs-title">
        <h2 id="docs-title">문서.</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <a class="tile doc" href={url('privacy.html')}>
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8-7 10-4-2-7-5.5-7-10V6z"></path><path d="M9.5 12l1.8 1.8L15 10"></path></svg>
            <strong>개인정보 처리방침</strong>
            <span>어떤 정보를 왜 처리하고 언제 지우는지.</span>
            <span class="go">읽어 보기 ›</span>
          </a>
          <a class="tile doc" href={url('terms.html')}>
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 3h7l4 4v14H7z"></path><path d="M14 3v4h4"></path><path d="M10 12h5M10 15.5h5"></path></svg>
            <strong>공공 사건기록보관소 이용약관</strong>
            <span>사건을 올리고 받을 때 지킬 것, 리뷰, 신고와 차단.</span>
            <span class="go">읽어 보기 ›</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="support" class="support" aria-labelledby="support-title">
        <div class="support-text">
          <h2 id="support-title">중앙우체국.</h2>
          <p>문의는 앱 안에서 편지로. 로그인하지 않아도 보낼 수 있고, 답신은 내 우편함에 도착해요.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Mac: Casebook › 설정 › 중앙우체국</li>
            <li>iPhone · iPad: 프로필 › 설정 › 중앙우체국</li>
            <li>Apple Vision Pro: 앱의 계정 화면에서 문의 방법을 안내해요</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="note">계정 비활성화와 삭제는 앱의 설정 › 계정 › 계정 삭제에서 언제든 할 수 있어요.</p>
          <p class="note">앱을 열 수 없다면 <a href={url('privacy.html#p11')}>개인정보 처리방침의 문의처</a>로 연락해 주세요.</p>
        </div>
        <Image class="support-image" src={postOffice} alt="빗속의 중앙우체국 건물" widths={[640, 1024]} sizes="(max-width: 734px) 100vw, 500px" />
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero { background: var(--dark-bg); color: var(--dark-fg); text-align: center; }
  .hero-inner {
    max-width: calc(980px + var(--gutter) * 2);
    padding-top: 72px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .product { margin: 0; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark-muted); }
  h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 56px; line-height: 1.07; letter-spacing: -0.005em; }
  .lede { margin: 6px 0 0; max-width: 640px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.38; }
  .cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px 28px; margin-top: 18px; }
  .store { min-height: 44px; padding: 0 22px; background: var(--dark-fg); color: #1d1d1f; }
  .store:hover { color: #1d1d1f; }
  .hero .more { color: var(--dark-link); }
  .hero .more:hover { color: var(--dark-fg); }
  .platforms { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--dark-muted); }
  .hero-image { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; object-fit: cover; margin-top: 40px; border-radius: var(--radius) var(--radius) 0 0; }

  .home { background: var(--bg-alt); }
  .sections { padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 100px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 88px; }
  section:not(.hero) { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; }
  h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.1; }
  .section-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }

  .doc { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 32px; }
  .doc strong { font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.17; font-weight: 600; }
  .doc span { color: var(--muted); }

  .support.support {
    flex-direction: row;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--dark-bg);
    color: var(--dark-fg);
  }
  .support-text { flex: 1 1 380px; min-width: 0; padding: 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; }
  .support-text p { margin: 0; font-size: 19px; }
  .support-text ul { margin: 4px 0 0; padding-left: 1.1em; color: var(--dark-sub); font-size: 15px; }
  .support-text .note { font-size: 15px; color: var(--dark-sub); }
  .support-text a { color: var(--dark-fg); text-decoration: underline; }
  .support-text a:hover { color: var(--dark-fg); opacity: 0.8; }
  .support-image { flex: 1 1 380px; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%; min-height: 320px; object-fit: cover; }

  @media (max-width: 734px) {
    .hero-inner { padding-top: 48px; gap: 10px; }
    .product { font-size: 17px; }
    h1 { font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.11; }
    .lede { font-size: 17px; }
    .cta { flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; margin-top: 12px; }
    .hero-image { aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; margin-top: 20px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0 0; }
    .sections { padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 64px; gap: 48px; }
    section:not(.hero) { gap: 16px; }
    h2 { font-size: 28px; }
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
    .doc { padding: 24px; }
    .doc strong { font-size: 21px; }
    .support-text { order: 2; padding: 24px 20px 28px; }
    .support-text p { font-size: 17px; }
    .support-image { order: 1; min-height: 0; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; }
  }
</style>
